pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  # ===== NAV BAR =====
  - elementId: nav-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"

  - elementId: nav-active
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 320, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: nav-t1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [0, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度一: Source</p>

  - elementId: nav-t2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [320, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度二: Propagation</p>

  - elementId: nav-t3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度三: Sink</p>

  - elementId: nav-t4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [960, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度四: Verification</p>

  - elementId: nav-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 40, 1280, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  # ===== TITLE & BADGE =====
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 54, 880, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>LARA — URI-Key结构化与LLM语义分析</p>

  - elementId: badge-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [1050, 58, 170, 28]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1050, 58, 170, 28]
    content:
      style: "$badge"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>USENIX Security 2024</p>

  # ===== LEFT COLUMN =====
  - elementId: left-bar-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 108, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: left-subtitle-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 106, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>内容摘要</p>

  - elementId: left-body-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 142, 360, 190]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>首次提出融合URI-Key结构化建模与LLM代码语义理解的Web输入源识别方法。将输入结构化为URI和Key的映射，通过模式匹配与LLM交叉验证识别隐藏输入，执行键值敏感污点分析。</p>

  - elementId: left-bar-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 348, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: left-subtitle-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 346, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>研究背景</p>

  - elementId: left-body-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 382, 360, 230]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>现有技术依赖精确匹配，遗漏隐藏Key且产生语义误报。缺乏代码上下文理解导致大量漏报和误判。传统模式匹配无法理解代码语义，只要参数中包含类似关键字即被错误标记。</p>

  # ===== MIDDLE COLUMN =====
  - elementId: mid-bar-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [440, 108, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: mid-subtitle-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [452, 106, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>核心洞察</p>

  - elementId: mid-body-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [440, 142, 360, 220]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>Insight 1: 用户输入可结构化分类为"URI-Key"二元结构，利用已知URI可推导出隐藏Key。</p>
        <p>Insight 2: LLM辅助语义理解，模式匹配与LLM误报原因正交，取交集可过滤语义误报。</p>

  - elementId: mid-bar-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [440, 372, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: mid-subtitle-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [452, 370, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>解决方案</p>

  - elementId: mid-body-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [440, 404, 360, 250]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>1. 预处理：提取前端文件和后端程序，正则和AST提取初始URI和Key。</p>
        <p>2. 污点源提取：模式匹配+LLM辅助定位URI和Key处理函数。</p>
        <p>3. 汇聚点提取：递归提取危险函数及其多层包装函数。</p>
        <p>4. 污点分析：键值敏感前向静态分析。</p>

  # ===== RIGHT COLUMN: 关键数据 =====
  - elementId: right-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [820, 108, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: right-subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [832, 106, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>关键数据</p>

  - elementId: card1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [840, 150, 340, 120]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 165, 300, 42]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>5.4x</p>

  - elementId: card1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 215, 300, 24]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>URI 提取提升（vs SaTC）</p>

  - elementId: card2-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [840, 290, 340, 120]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 305, 300, 42]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>556</p>

  - elementId: card2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 355, 300, 24]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>多发现漏洞（vs SaTC）</p>

  - elementId: card3-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [840, 430, 340, 120]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 445, 300, 42]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>245</p>

  - elementId: card3-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 495, 300, 24]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>0-day 漏洞</p>

  # ===== FOOTER =====
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 690, 400, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>网络设备Web服务安全研究</p>

  - elementId: footer-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1100, 690, 120, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>9 / 37</p>
